abstract: >-
  Code, raw results, and figures for a replication study of experience replay in a
  five-agent LLM pipeline. Across fifteen controlled comparisons on two language models,
  no replay effect reproduces; the study identifies the resolution of the retrieval key,
  rather than the size of the store, as the parameter governing what the mechanism can
  return.
